'''Top of the Bog''' (絶・ほの暗い沼の底から ''Zetsu Honogurai Numa no Soko Kara'', '''From the Bottom of a Dim Swamp - End''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] and appears on the 13th, 14th, 27th, and 28th of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Bottom of the Swamp]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first cleared, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] - Cadaver BearCat. It was added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]].

